Microsoft - Pex

A part of Apache Pex, which is a set of automated unit tests that are built into Microsoft Visual Studio 2010 Professional Edition and later versions. Automatically generate test input for unit tests, and highlight potential bugs or areas of concern. 

Microsoft Pex can even generate code coverage for your tests, telling you which parts of your test project did not get exercised by your automated unit tests. 

Here is the link to MS Pex documentation, you may get more information about it: [Microsoft Pex](https://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/hh690658.asci
ednl)

Hope it helps ! If you face any issues or have any further questions , kindly let us know !
